# Course material and everything derived from it. The PT Certification content is
# copyrighted and must never be committed: raw files, the extracted text, the chunks and
# the FAISS index all carry it.
#
# Written without a leading directory on purpose. The previous patterns were
# "data/processed/" and friends, which git anchors to the repository root, so they never
# matched backend/data/ and 237 files were tracked for months.
data/
*.pdf
*.xlsx
*.docx
*.csv

# Offline evaluation runs. Each result file embeds the retrieved course passages in its
# `contexts` field, so the runs stay local and only their scores are quoted in the README.
backend/evaluation/results/

# FAISS indexes
*.index
*.faiss

